Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.50,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.03,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.59,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:11.11,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You're acting like this is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.76,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We'll be fine as long as we do even better at the next Idol GrandPrix!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:17.45,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to Mega-niisan...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:21.05,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Now that he's handed Shikyouin-san PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:23.47,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,what will happen to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.44,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's because I accepted her challenge back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:29.73,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll take you up on it!{EP73}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:33.65,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}And your arraignment will have to wait until we win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:36.99,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We don't get to arrest her, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.99,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It's vexing-dearu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:41.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,My innate power didn't come out, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:43.77,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Don't let it get to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.39,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We put everything we had into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:47.99,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That's all we could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:51.88,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It was the best performance we've put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.31,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:55.09,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,It was a first-rate performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:58.25,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Don't let yourself get discouraged, President Minami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.25,0:01:00.59,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,After all, I've been watching over you this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:02.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara announcement:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.37,0:01:06.60,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Good morning PriPara TV viewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:11.82,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Our first daily press conference with\NShikyouin Hibiki-sama is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.75,Default,Friendols,0,0,0,,Daily press conference?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:15.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This is Shikyouin Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As previously mentioned, starting today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:22.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,PriPara is being given a new chance at a dazzling future as CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:56.44,Default,Many,0,0,0,,Let's go! CelePara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:01.88,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This is its emblem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:03.79,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,CelePara is for celebrities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:09.06,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That is, it's a place where only those who possess both skill and glamour gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As such, a new catch phrase befitting that image is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.65,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Disparity is Accepted!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:20.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Everyone's your rival!\NOnly celebs are idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:23.04,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:25.94,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Isn't it "We're all friends! We're all idols"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:29.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As for CelePara, everything has been reset,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.60,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and it's currently undergoing expansive renovations for its revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.54,Default,Friendols,0,0,0,,Expansive renovations?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:37.99,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And to grace its reopening ceremonies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:41.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,the winners of the Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:43.58,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,namely myself and CelePara Theatre Company,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.26,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,will be holding their début concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:46.63,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.62,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This has been Shikyouin Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:50.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Au revoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,CelePara?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:54.53,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What's she mean by CelePara?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:57.12,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,There's no way it'll go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:04:00.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,There's no mention of this in the Aloma Prophesy Grimore-dearu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:03.18,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She should have done ShabPara for a shabby celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:06.03,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'll just have to see what it's like with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.61,0:04:09.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's meet up at PriPara after school is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:12.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Okay, Prez?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.22,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:16.95,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'd like to know how Kuma is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:19.17,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Expansive renovations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:26.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Last time I only had five minutes in here;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:30.97,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,however, thanks to these glasses,\NI can stay as long as I want this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:43.84,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.82,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like anything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:49.99,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,So much for CelePara and it's expansive renovations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:57.71,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,As I thought, nothing's chang{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:04:58.96,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wha?!?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.35,Default,All,0,0,0,,A castle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,That's... CelePara?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.73,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,There's no one here-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where'd everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:24.36,Default,Mega-nees,0,0,0,,Welcome to CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.08,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.86,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.50,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please follow me, Nanami-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:44.24,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupiko~n!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:46.39,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sakura-sama, Momo-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:48.69,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,may I offer you two a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:51.13,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:52.18,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,welcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:53.39,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,...to CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:54.95,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:56.97,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,...your personal escorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:59.23,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This way, Dorothy-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:00.37,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:01.64,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I can go around on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:02.48,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You too, Leona-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:03.61,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,S-Sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:04.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You as well, Lala-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:05.58,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:07.47,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Mirei-sama, please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:08.19,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.22,Default,Rand,0,0,0,,These luxuries are wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.16,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama has such wonderful taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.34,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,That's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.08,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,This is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.58,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,For the Fairies of the Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:23.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I present this decadent delight,\NPanna Cotta with Franboise Sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.59,Default,Rand,0,0,0,,How pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:26.54,Default,Rand,0,0,0,,It looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.74,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Detox-glo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:34.47,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I was so worried about what PriPara was going to turn into...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:38.66,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,...that I ended up forgetting about the small stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It seems like everyone's enjoying themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.50,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What's good about detoxing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.13,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,A life without toxins is boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:46.59,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Bring on the toxins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:47.72,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Tension max!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.36,Default,LEona,0,0,0,,Rela{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:49.36,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fs70}Detox!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:55.07,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You know, we can do things on our own,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.47,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,so you don't need to follow us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.16,Default,Mega-nees,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.24,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,She's saying we're fine-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.27,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,Way to go, Sophie-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:12.26,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Finish up your assignment and come back, Prodigy Team-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.18,Default,Love,0,0,0,,The hill angle is 15-love!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.39,Default,Eiko,0,0,0,,Lala-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:21.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, Eiko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.98,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Isn't this more like your average amusement park?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:29.92,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Just 'cause you take a kid to an amusement park doesn't mean they'll enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:33.69,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But don't you love amusement parks, Dorothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Doth thou plan on following me everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:43.20,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Just being with Aloma is enough-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou aught to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:49.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We are on different teams until thee hasith thy début concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.17,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,So stop following me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:53.67,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't run away-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:56.89,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Look, a ginormous meat bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.57,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:58.87,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Where? Where?! Where?! Where?!?! WHERE?!?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:00.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,There's no way one could fly-dearu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:02.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah, Alom{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:06.27,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She ran off-nano...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:07.55,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's it-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:11.73,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma must be so hungry she left Mikan behind-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:13.94,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Over here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:17.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Woah! What's with these chairs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:18.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,They're so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:22.55,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You know, soft chairs are bad for your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:25.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,This water's fizzing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:30.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,It says it's naturally carbonated water from the southern Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.14,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Isn't it good for your complexion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.05,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,At least that's what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.76,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,The free water is carbonated water-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:42.49,Default-Alt,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You learned that carbonated water is made by\Ninjecting water with carbon dioxide in science class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.49,0:08:44.97,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey, someone bring us some normal tap water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:46.93,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.48,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,But are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:50.55,Default,Dola,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.15,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Ah, so this is where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:52.99,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where have you been, Aloma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.19,0:08:56.82,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:09:00.53,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Two meat buns for Aloma and Mikan, please-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.53,0:09:02.96,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We don't sell meat buns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:06.43,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Instead, we are selling this popular favourite in Hollywood:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:13.12,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,a brown sugar and select natural fruity flavoured\NRoyal Special Gourmet Popcorn in a premium container!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Meat buns...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.92,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Don't have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.84,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Everything is going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:25.06,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,PriPara is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:28.99,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The Spring Dream Idol GrandPrix falls under my responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:31.27,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and so does the Dream Parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:34.72,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.69,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Mikan-sama is nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:37.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:38.70,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We don't have long until our début concert,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,so go find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:43.73,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Meh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Actually, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:46.76,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Meh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:49.90,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a break and have some sparkling water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.42,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It'll raise your manliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm in a good mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.67,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Meh.... Hibiki-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:58.36,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,here is Mikan-sama's raising guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:09:59.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:02.34,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,But isn't this a bit much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What's with this water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What's in it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.17,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Carbon dioxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:20.89,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Who drinks this carbonated stuff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.72,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Don't take a demon for a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.74,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Please bring some normal tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.90,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,In that case, to Leona!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.20,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Tension max!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:30.41,Default,Doroma,0,0,0,,Pleasance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:32.87,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,Ahh, Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.94,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,CelePara is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:41.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.80,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You girls seem to be enjoying yourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:47.26,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,...here in my new CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.72,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Yes, as you can see, we're having a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.49,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Especially with this pompous gas water from wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:52.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Bubble water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:53.15,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Carbonated water...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.60,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Actually, we're drinking normal tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That's enough, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:58.70,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Rather, it's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:00.28,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,That's what's in my right hand, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.55,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:03.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Seems like you're enjoying yourselves plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.23,Default,Doroma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:06.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Anyway,  have you girls seen Mikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:08.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:09.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No clue where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:13.67,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Garçonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:17.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Get these young ladies another pitcher of normal tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:19.17,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:20.93,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now then, ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:23.27,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,please continue enjoying CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.14,Default,Rand5,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:39.06,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's lonely without meat buns-nano...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:42.53,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,And there's no Aloma-nano...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:46.49,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,So this is where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:48.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Our début concert is taking place soon;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:50.28,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.49,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Come quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.34,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,"If it's a meat bun you want, I have one."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:10.64,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,"Let's get five meat buns, so come on, 'kay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:11.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Five?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:14.14,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,In that case, let's go-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,These five brand-new idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,wrapped in a shiny future...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,...and summoned by heavenly providence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,now descend upon the Dream Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:30.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now, let us open a new door,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:32.20,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and open up the new celebrity world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.23,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We are CelePara Theatre Company!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:37.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, their début concert is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:39.30,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We should probably go see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:40.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:41.25,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Probably should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:44.26,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's probably rude, but I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:45.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're not going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Then I won't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:49.05,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.05,0:12:52.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Tis' be no chance of winning if thee not know thine enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:57.48,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Besides, there are other things we also need to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:01.83,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You're all still motivated-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:08.73,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Won't you scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:13.12,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Only Celebs can scan here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.17,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:23.59,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The large plumes that sprout from the waist give off the image of a peacock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:26.00,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,My emblem is embroidered on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.88,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Escort Cinema Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:34.05,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's quite a passionate red, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:37.05,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,See, everyone's eyes are glued to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.14,Default,Shikan,0,0,0,,Ballroom Cinema Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:39.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:45.61,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Aren't the gems the skirts are studded with dazzling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:48.55,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Let's put on a concert that will not lose to their radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.61,Default,Shilulu,0,0,0,,Ballroom Pearl Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:14:01.02,Default,CelePara Opera Company,0,0,0,,Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:25.17,Default,Hibiki,0,0,45,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:31.09,Default,Hibiki,0,0,45,,Golden Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.84,Default,Rest,0,0,45,,Golden Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.35,Default,Rest,0,0,45,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.85,Default,Rest,0,0,45,,Everyone's sparkling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.89,Default,Rest,0,0,45,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:48.44,Default,Mikan,0,0,45,,May you have Heaven's blessing-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:08.61,Default,Solulu,0,0,45,,Ring the bell of everyone's dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:11.80,Default,Shikan,0,0,0,,Aim for a limitless height.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:17.08,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Echo, Bell of Revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:26.69,Default,Rand6,0,0,0,,They're so much better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:29.46,Default,Rand7,0,0,0,,We don't really need to perform any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.97,Default,Rand8,0,0,0,,Watching CelePara Theatre Company is good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.95,Default,Rand9,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:35.08,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:36.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:39.70,Default,Rand10,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.21,Default,Rand11,0,0,0,,CelePara is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.66,Default,Rand12,0,0,0,,It really is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:45.67,Default,Rand13,0,0,0,,Want to snap Friend Tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:50.13,Default,Rand14,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry... but I don't snap with people in different ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.68,Default,Rand15,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:57.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hold on, Friend Tickets have nothing to do with your rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:00.34,Default,Rand15,0,0,0,,But in CelePara, disparity is welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:04.06,Default,Rand15,0,0,0,,Celebs should snap with other celebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:05.19,Default,BothRands,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:06.45,Default,Rand14,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:07.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:10.02,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,This is CelePara-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:12.22,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:13.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:15.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma found-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:16.44,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Mikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:18.90,Default,Rand16,0,0,0,,Oh my, it's Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.49,Default-Alt,Rand17,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.34,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:25.12,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Now that our début concert is over, the team is disbanding-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.33,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,No, we're staying together until spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:28.65,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.29,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's not what you promised-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.00,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I make the rules in CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:37.33,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Everyone is happy enough watching just our concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:41.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Besides, there isn't another team that can beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.18,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's pointless to even compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.39,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,In that case, Mikan quits-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:47.70,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.85,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,If it's a meat bun you want, I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:51.53,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Being with Aloma is the most important thing to Mikan-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:57.51,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The 2nd is also Aloma, as is the 3rd, 4th, 5th, and 6th...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.82,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Each and every one is Aloma...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:03.04,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,...all the way to 99th, which is a meat bun-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:05.84,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:08.79,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,if you lose her, the Autumn Coord ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:12.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If this is what you want, I'll give it to you-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:13.71,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:16.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan and Aloma will be together from here on out-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.99,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Even if that means travelling to hell-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:23.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,In that case, I might also ascend to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:23.87,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:27.26,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If that happens, we might miss each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:35.36,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko is useless in CelePara as well-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:38.86,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Let Toriko into your group-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:41.49,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:48.60,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,A-Are you Mega-nii-tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:49.66,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:52.62,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Y-You're wrong. You must be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:53.86,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Wait-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:57.47,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Talk with Toriko and these bird friends-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:02.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,He fell all the way into ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:03.37,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Meh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.12,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Well now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Back to the drawing board.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:13.19,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,But, as long as I have this, it won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The system is under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:23.01,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's time to put the final touches on this revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:23.81,Default,Andou-goat,0,0,0,,Meh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:36.88,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.00,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:41.34,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Become one of Toriko's bird friends-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:44.40,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,Wai...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll perform with you whenever you need motivation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:50.13,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's been a while since the two of us have performed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:51.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:55.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mega-neesan in black, I'd like an entry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:56.48,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.94,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,But I'm not in the mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:02.65,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Besides, where is Kuma and the others-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.11,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ah, M-Mirei?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:06.36,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:07.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Kuma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:09.11,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Usagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:09.11,Default-Alt,Leona,0,0,0,,Usagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:12.08,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The manager system has been suspended-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:16.08,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,And we've been hired as castle attendants-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:19.68,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I used to be an elite manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.79,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.55,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You're kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:25.70,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Mirei, you must keep performing-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:28.23,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,As long as you perform, your future is still wide open-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:28.91,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:32.22,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Even if I've been fired, I'm still your manager in my heart-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.18,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Your entry has been rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:35.32,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:36.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:38.19,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.55,0:22:18.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why can't we perform?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:20.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's going on with the CelePara System?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:22.62,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Why has this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:25.61,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,If I can't return PriPara to normal, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:26.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:30.02,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,The End of Idoling-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.02,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
